1
00:00:00,190 --> 00:00:01,470
(Leonard:)Be like my Aunt Nancy.

2
00:00:01,470 --> 00:00:02,840
(Leonard:)She had dozens of them.

3
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:05,310
(Leonard:)And do you know what happened
after she died? They ate her.

4
00:00:05,310 --> 00:00:07,980
(Sheldon:)You don't have to sell
me on cats, Leonard.

5
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:09,200
(Sheldon:)I'm already a fan.

6
00:00:13,620 --> 00:00:17,870
(Sheldon:)All right, fellas,
who's in the mood for Fancy Feast?

7
00:00:17,870 --> 00:00:20,860
(Sheldon:)Well, that's not fancy at all.

8
00:00:25,630 --> 00:00:27,210
(Leonard:)Hi, Mrs. Cooper. Thanks for coming.

9
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:28,300
(Mrs Cooper:)Where is he?

10
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:29,470
(Leonard:)He's in his bedroom.

11
00:00:29,470 --> 00:00:32,250
(Mrs Cooper:)Now, when you said on the phone

12
00:00:32,250 --> 00:00:34,760
(Mrs Cooper:)he broke up with a girl,
you meant an actual girl,

13
00:00:34,760 --> 00:00:37,260
(Mrs Cooper:)not something you kids
whipped up in a lab?

14
00:00:37,260 --> 00:00:38,810
(Leonard:)No, she's real.

15
00:00:38,810 --> 00:00:40,840
(Mrs Cooper:)Did they sin?

16
00:00:40,850 --> 00:00:42,880
(Leonard:)No, no, it's not like that.

17
00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:44,980
(Leonard:)It's, uh...

18
00:00:44,980 --> 00:00:46,680
(Leonard:)I don't know what it's like.

19
00:00:46,680 --> 00:00:48,600
(Leonard:)But there is something I
should prepare you for.

20
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:52,270
(Mrs Cooper:)Oh, relax, Leonard,
I have raised that boy.

21
00:00:52,270 --> 00:00:54,830
(Mrs Cooper:)I've seen him at his best,
I've seen him at his worst.

22
00:00:54,830 --> 00:00:57,440
(Mrs Cooper:)There's nothing he can
do that'll surprise me.

23
00:00:57,450 --> 00:00:59,280
(Leonard:)Hold on to that thought.

